<title>UK: UK grain traders seek free market wheat.</title>
<headline>UK grain traders seek free market wheat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Intervention Board for Agricultural Produce said on Thursday there was an interest from UK grain traders for free market soft wheat at the weekly European Union (EU) grain tender, but could give no further details.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
